  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How do I stop impulse buying online? My cart is always full of random stuff, Moshi.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "block": "shopping.dlg4",
   "kind": "moshi_name",
   "name_pos": "end",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Try a waiting rule. Leave things in the cart for two days before buying, and see if you still want them.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait a second, that doesn't sound right.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "block": "shopping.dlg4",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'm fairly sure about it, but I could be wrong. What sounds off to you?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's smart. Most of it I'd forget about.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "block": "shopping.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's the idea. It also helps to remove your saved card so checkout takes a bit more effort.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ugh, but that's so annoying.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "block": "shopping.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's kind of the point. And unsubscribe from store emails, the sales announcements are designed to make you click.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I'm going to",
